      "id": "gascona-foncalada",
      "name": "Gascona / Foncalada — cider circuit",
      "note": "Gascona is the Bulevar de la Sidra: a concentrated stop for poured cider and Asturian dishes, with Foncalada nearby. Look for a sidrería whose menu suits you and compare prices before sitting down. A prominent visitor destination; visit selectively rather than assuming the busiest terrace is the best fit. Fit for this trip: medium.",
