      "id": "fontan-trascorrales",
      "name": "El Fontán / Trascorrales & southern old town",
      "note": "The market and old-town squares are a good setting for an aperitivo and a small-plate wander. Look for vermouth, pinchos and Asturian ingredients; the saved Pinchito stop anchors this end of the walk. Fontán is much visited, so browse the menu and side streets rather than choosing purely for the square. Fit for this trip: high.",
